I'm a software engineer, and I love building things. I don't care if the idea isn't unique, or if it isn't something that changes the world.

I enjoy building, creating, and giving life to things, no matter if it's a piece of woodwork or a desktop application like [Edyt](https://edyt.app).

My work centers on applied AI: model-backed features that hold up in production, and engineering workflows in which coding agents complete entire tasks.
